'' A slice of fbc's own corpus must parse with no diagnostics. The full 2,709-file
'' gate is build/sweep.sh; this keeps the fast suite honest.
''
'' These two files are deliberately NOT fbcunit-based: a '#if' inside a '#macro' body
'' is not yet evaluated at expansion time, which is the largest remaining parse gap.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --parse-only tests/parser/src/statements.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: FBX04
